cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "Analysis code for: Genetic architecture of Bell's palsy: a 6p21.1 locus replicated in UK Biobank and no classical HLA association in 5,062 Finnish cases"
abstract: >-
  Python and R code implementing harmonisation, meta-analysis, SuSiE credible-set
  handling, colocalisation, credible-set interrogation, the independent UK Biobank
  (ICD-10 G51) replication look-up, cross-trait Mendelian randomisation and all
  figures for a genome-wide association analysis of Bell's palsy in 5,062 Finnish
  cases and 431,627 controls.
type: software
license: MIT
version: "1.1"
date-released: "2026-10-14"
authors:
  - family-names: "Zhang"
    given-names: "Fanlong"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-0492-0873"
